  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Den 302.01 Purpose. The purpose of this section is to establish the qualification requirements for dentists, dental hygienists and dental assistants pursuant to RSA 317-A:12, XII-b.\n\nSource. #287.2, eff 1-17-74; ss by #2981, eff 2-28-85; ss by #5110, eff 4-4-91; ss by #6186, eff 2-17-96; ss by #6909, eff 12-9-98, EXPIRED: 12-9-06\n\nNew. #8838, eff 3-9-07; ss by #10794, eff 3-7-15",
